    <item>
      <title>MySQL 环境配置</title>
      <link>/posts/mysql-deploy/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 20 Feb 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>/posts/mysql-deploy/</guid>
      <description><![CDATA[<h1 id="ubuntu" data-numberify>Ubuntu<a class="anchor ms-1" href="#ubuntu"></a></h1>
<p>MySQL 8 安装：</p>
<ol>
<li>
<p>首先更新本地存储库索引：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="ln">1</span><span class="cl">sudo apt update
</span></span></code></pre></div></li>
<li>
<p>从 APT 存储库安装 MySQL：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="ln">1</span><span class="cl">sudo apt install MySQL-server -y
</span></span></code></pre></div></li>
<li>
<p>查看 MySQL 版本，验证是否安装成功：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="ln">1</span><span class="cl">mysql --version
</span></span></code></pre></div></li>
<li>
<p>检查 MySQL 是否正在运行：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="ln">1</span><span class="cl">systemctl status mysql.service
</span></span></code></pre></div></li>
</ol>
<p>如果服务未运行：</p>]]></description>
